"""The shared trait vocabulary. Every system (Western, Vedic, numerology) votes on these traits;
the reading is composed from the winners. Original text.

Fields:
 tag      - one-line identity           strength - how it helps you
 watch    - how it can trip you         develop  - how to build it if it's low
 career   - environments/roles that fit work - how you work
 hobbies  - what recharges you          love     - how you love
 seek     - what to look for in a partner (whole-trait view)
 avoid    - patterns to be wary of      stress   - how pressure shows + a reset
 money    - money temperament           gives    - what a partner strong in this brings
"""

